# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed: this crate builds executables, and the
# book depends on readers resolving the same dependency versions it was written
# against. https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/guide/cargo-toml-vs-cargo-lock.html

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb
